<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Time after time He has called me;</l><l>Now His footsteps I’ll take willingly;</l><l>Lord, leave me no longer unbroken,</l><l>Let Your life have its full way in me.</l><l>Sow me in the ground;</l><l>Resurrection will bud in life!</l><l>Then fruit will abound,</l><l>Hundredfold ’twill multiply!</l><l>Time after time He has called me;</l><l>Now His footsteps I’ll take willingly;</l><l>Lord, leave me no longer unbroken,</l><l>Let Your life have its full way in me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
